OL,3,GNEWSAYouth football games for 750
OL,4,Achildren cancelled over bad behaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 750 children across the Central
OL,7,FBelt will be on the sidelines this
OL,8,Fweekend after youth football fixtures
OL,9,Fwere suspended due to bad behaviour.
OL,11,FThe Central Scotland Football
OL,12,FAssociation announced that its Fun 4
OL,13,Fgames, for players aged between five
OL,14,Fand six, would not go ahead after a
OL,15,Flack of discipline from adults and
OL,16,Fchildren at last weekend's event.
OL,18,FParents, coaches and referees have told
OL,19,FBBC Scotland News that incidents like
OL,20,Fthis have become common across
OL,21,Fgrassroots football.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
